CommitDate: Tue Oct 20 11:21:31 2026 -0300

    Preserve Game Gear I/O state across savestates
    
    Preserve Game Gear I/O registers and local serial protocol state across savestate save/load cycles, including PDR/DDR, TX/RX state, transfer progress, status flags, synchronizer history, and local NMI sources.
    
    Extend the tagged savestate payload to version 2 while keeping the existing HCounter extension layout unchanged. Legacy snapshots remain supported and
    deterministically reset Game Gear state that was not previously stored.
    
    Add directed serial replay and full DDRAM save/load coverage, including legacy and invalid metadata, transfer stalls, and non-Game Gear modes.

